Adversarial audit
Every completed historical block will be challenged for:

New York or coastal over-centralization;
Southern, Midwestern, regional, and global flattening;
erasure of women, queer artists, DJs, producers, dancers, organizers, or local media;
nostalgia masquerading as musical analysis;
treating commercial success or obscurity as proof of quality;
weak, clichéd, or redundant selections;
false invention claims and unsupported anecdotes;
clean edits, reissues, altered samples, remasters, or mislabeled versions;
contemporary condescension and token representation;
SoundCloud links whose provenance or playability has not been verified.

Explicit content is eligible. Platform labels may be shown as information, but they will not determine inclusion.
